    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Tom spends $\\frac{3}{4}$ of an hour doing homework 5 times a week.\n\nHow long does he spend doing homework in 6 weeks? Answer as a mixed number.",
    "layout": "list",
